<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index fell 5.92 to 646.15.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.16.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 389 to 168.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 27,357,660 compared with 25,050,990 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
</text>
